    "title": "Report: Grizzlies waive Russell ahead of camp - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jonathan Soveta ,\n1 days ago The Memphis Grizzlies waived veteran guard D'Angelo Russell, sources told Shams Charania of ESPN. Russell, 30, landed in Memphis from the Washington Wizards in July as part of a six-team swap that included 10 other players, including John Collins heading to the Detroit Pistons and Khris Middleton returning to Washington. The Grizzlies were reportedly expected to part with Russell after acquiring him. Read full article",
